* Mutant: a 7 kohm poly resistor in series with the vinp gate adds its thermal noise to the input,
* so input-referred noise exceeds 50 uVrms (with the gate capacitance it also costs bandwidth
* and phase margin, but still passes the nominal gate, so the noise check runs)
.subckt ota_5t vss ibias vdd vinn vinp vout
XM1 nleft vinp_g tail vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.9 w=90 nf=10
XM2 vout vinn tail vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.9 w=90 nf=10
XM3 nleft nleft vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.9 w=100 nf=20
XM4 vout nleft vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.9 w=100 nf=20
XM5 tail ibias vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=1.5 w=300 nf=30
XM6 ibias ibias vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=1.5 w=90 nf=9
XRP vinp vinp_g vss sky130_fd_pr__res_xhigh_po w=1 l=3.5
.ends ota_5t
